The Gamate machine adapts MAME's gamate.cpp, copyright Peter Trauner
(GPL-2.0-or-later). The LCD adapts gamate_v.cpp, copyright David Haywood,
Peter Wilhelmsen and Kevtris. Cartridge and protection logic are based on
rom.cpp and gamate_protection.cpp, copyright David Haywood. AY synthesis
is based on ay8910.cpp, copyright Couriersud. These device sources are
BSD-3-Clause; see third_party/MAME-BSD.txt. Cartridge metadata is from
MAME hash/gamate.xml (CC0-1.0).

The NMOS 6502 operation lists, arithmetic and resampling algorithm
are adapted from MAME, copyright Olivier Galibert (BSD-3-Clause).
libretro.h retains the libretro project's MIT notice. Platform make rules
are adapted from libretro/Potator, The Unlicense (see its LICENSE).
The Pico palette file format and default RGB values are interoperable
with pico-gamate. No Pico firmware, BIOS or game data is distributed.

